python3-qemu-tool (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add 'qemu-tool list' subcommand to list running QEMU VMs on the node,
    including VMs inside containers
  * Stamp VMs launched by run-vm and gen-vm with -name/-uuid identity markers
    so list can identify which VMs qemu-tool started

