python3-qemu-tool (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add Debian package (python3-qemu-tool) for system-wide installation
  * Change default image directory to /var/lib/qemu-tool/images (kvm group writable)
  * Change default packages manifest to /usr/share/qemu-tool/packages-default
  * Add man page for qemu-tool(1)

